{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every dream has an ending.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fully remastered edition of the original <i>Dream:scape</i>, you step into the subconscious of Wilson, a man lying in a hospital bed with only minutes to live. Trapped in a surreal dream world woven from his memories, Wilson must explore the people, places, and regrets that shaped his life \u2014 before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuilt in Unreal Engine 5 with enhanced visuals, sound, and controls, <i>Dream:scape Remastered</i> preserves the award-winning narrative of the original with modern improvements for a new generation of players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the landscapes of memory</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through a quiet rural town, sunlit fields, and shadowed woods \u2014 each holding fragments of Wilson\u2019s past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with objects and landmarks that trigger pivotal memories and reveal his story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets and hidden connections in a non-linear world that changes as you progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remastered Presentation</strong> \u2013 Modern lighting, textures, and environmental detail bring the dream to life like never before.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Rich First-Person Exploration</strong> \u2013 No combat, no timers \u2014 just an immersive journey through one man\u2019s life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Narrative</strong> \u2013 Uncover bittersweet memories, long-buried regrets, and final revelations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong> \u2013 Fully re-mastered to enhance the dreamlike atmosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Wilson\u2019s final dream \u2014 and find out what he\u2019s been running from all his life.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884540?t=1759252365","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884540/5a35c001321b9f4fac1f6eff14af9c0b4b8a54cf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759252365","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884540/d42d566803226d8acc683320cf14b5a6e03fea58/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759252365","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884540/d42d566803226d8acc683320cf14b5a6e03fea58/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759252365","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game deals with trauma and loss both visually and narratively. It may not be appropriate for players under 12."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every dream has an ending.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fully remastered edition of the original <i>Dream:scape</i>, you step into the subconscious of Wilson, a man lying in a hospital bed with only minutes to live. Trapped in a surreal dream world woven from his memories, Wilson must explore the people, places, and regrets that shaped his life \u2014 before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuilt in Unreal Engine 5 with enhanced visuals, sound, and controls, <i>Dream:scape Remastered</i> preserves the award-winning narrative of the original with modern improvements for a new generation of players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the landscapes of memory</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\">